  "description": "Native, code-first UI framework for .NET for iOS. Build UIKit apps with C# object initializers, AOT-safe MVVM bindings, layout, navigation, and controls—without MAUI or XAML.",
  "iconFile": "package-icon.png",
  "id": "SkeleKit.iOS",
