  "published": "2026-10-09T17:26:10.013Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Add native split views as app shell, tab destination or sidebar destination.\n- Add adaptive layout configuration to split views.\n- Add TabPlacement.Hidden for destinations that are only reached programmatically.\n- Add global Theme on SkeleApplication combining tint, appearance, navigation title style, top scroll edge and tab bar minimization.\n- Inherit Theme.NavigationTitleStyle and Theme.TopScrollEdgeStyle and apply theme changes live.\n- Add IMailer to compose mails.\n- Fix navigation bar accessory not respecting safe area.\n- Rename implicit styles API (Theme to Styles).\n- Add CollectionLayout.FixedGrid: a visible-only grid for large virtualized sources.\n- Add virtualized items and sections sources for very large collections, with major collection optimizations.\n- Rename InitialScrollPosition to DefaultScrollPosition and land system scroll-to-top gestures there.\n- Add native accessories to item views.\n- Make more view properties bindable.\n- Add dotted border strokes.\n- Add item aspect ratio to grid layouts.\n- Allow hiding the collection scroll indicator.\n- Fix action bubble placement and activation on iOS 18 and 27.\n- Cache color conversions for faster cell rebinds.\n- Fix application startup deadlocking with awaited lifecycle services.",
